{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17264","headline":"送袁中丞持节册南诏五韵 · 权德舆","name":"送袁中丞持节册南诏五韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西南使星去，远彻通朝聘。\n烟雨僰道深，麾幢汉仪盛。\n途轻五尺险，水爱双流净。\n上国洽恩波，外臣遵礼命。\n离堂驻驺驭，且尽罇中圣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}